"Connect to YougitAI, inspect the available repositories and review the selected project for secrets, proprietary "
"business logic, AI prompts, security logic, private endpoints, and reconstructable core IP. Start with metadata and "
"the repository tree, request source only where necessary, then create conservative redaction proposals. Do not "
"publish anything."
